#. <CLT 4>爆発は起きなかった。
#. ただ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was no explosion, thankfully.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの…第一印象は……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My first impression was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うわッ…！　ＳＦ…！？
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whoa! This place is totally sci-fi!"
msgstr ""

#. …ボクも同じ感想だよ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Yeah, I was kinda thinking the same thing."
msgstr ""

#. あ、苗木！　どうだった？
#. 今のってなんだったの！？
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whoa! Hey Makoto, what the heck was that just now!?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマだったよ…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Monokuma."
msgstr ""

#. …へ？　何が？
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Hả? Ý cậu là sao?"

#. 今、朝日奈さんが操ってたのは…
#. モノクマだったんだよ。
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What you were controlling just now. It was Monokuma."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマ……？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Monokuma...?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇっ！？　ホントにっ！？
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What!? For real!?"
msgstr "Cái gì!? Thật á!?"

#. 間違いないよ。そこの操作パネルは、
#. モノクマを操る為の物だったんだ…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yup. It looks like that panel definitely controls\n"
"Monokuma."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、黒幕は…
#. この部屋でモノクマを操作してたんだよ。
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which means...the mastermind has been controlling\n"
"Monokuma from this room."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだ…この部屋にいたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...they were definitely in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は…この部屋でモノクマを操ってたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind has been controlling Monokuma from this\n"
"room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、学園内を監視する情報処理室は、
#. このモノクマ操作室とは、<CLT><CLT 3>別の部屋<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And this control room is <CLT><CLT 3>totally separate<CLT><CLT 4> from the\n"
"data center area with all the monitors.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nói cách khác...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. もしかしたら、黒幕は私達の監視とモノクマの操作を
#. 同時に行えないのかもしれない…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Maybe the mastermind can't monitor us and control\n"
"Monokuma at the same time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>当たってたんだ…
#. あの時の霧切さんの言葉は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko's theory was right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…
#. 黒幕が、この部屋でモノクマを操ってたって事は…
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But...if the mastermind's been controlling Monokuma\n"
"from here..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕はずっと、この学園の中にいたって事だよね…？
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...that means they've been inside the school this\n"
"whole time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…そうなるね…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I guess that would have to be true."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そうなると……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if that *is* true...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. クックック…
#. むしろ、ついでにヒントをもう１つやるクマ…
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kehehe... It's a very polarizing approach, I know,\n"
"but—okay, enough puns. Anyway, here's a hint..."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、前にも言ったと思うクマ…
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm sure I told you this already, but..."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>の参加者は、
#. 全部で１６人の高校生だけだって…
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...this <CLT 3>killing game<CLT> began with sixteen\n"
"participants, all of them high school students."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、コロシアイ学園生活が始まった後、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に生きたまま足を踏み入れた人間も…
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the only people to take a single step in Hope's\n"
"Peak since the killing game began..."
msgstr ""

#. その１６人だけだったクマ。
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...are those sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、モノクマを操っていた黒幕って…
#. その１６人の誰か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then the mastermind, Monokuma's puppeteer, really is\n"
"the sixteenth student...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>いや…そんなはず……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, it can't be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Không, không thể nào..."

#. <CLT 4>そんなはず…ないんだよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no way...right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマの操作室<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma Control Room<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木、どうかした？
#. なんだか怖い顔してるけど…
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"What's wrong, Makoto? I don't like that face you're\n"
"making..."
msgstr ""

#. あっ、ううん…
#. なんでもないよ…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, no...it's nothing."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…それならいいんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "O-Oh, okay..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …朝日奈さんこそ、どうかしたの？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What about you? Is everything okay?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だってさ…なんだか不気味じゃん…
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh, well, it's just..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕がいた部屋なんだよ…
#. どんな罠が仕掛けられてるかわかんないし…
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"This is where the mastermind's been hiding, right? Who\n"
"knows if they set up traps or something...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>罠か…確かに可能性がない訳じゃないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't say it isn't possible...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あって欲しくない可能性だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I really hope it's not true.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だからさ…なんて言うか…
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So, like..."
msgstr ""

#. そろそろ出ない？
#. 他に捜査しなきゃいけない場所も残ってるしさ…
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You wanna leave soon? There's still lots of other\n"
"places to check out."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだね…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, good point."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、この部屋ばっかりに、
#. 時間を使う訳にはいかないし…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "We can't waste all our time standing around here."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、行こうか…？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, you wanna get going?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0047 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Y-Yeah..."
msgstr "Ừ-Ừm..."

#. どうしたの、苗木。
#. 早く外に行こうよ…
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"What's wrong, Makoto? Let's hurry up and get outta\n"
"here..."
msgstr ""

#. この学校って、あっちこっち趣味悪いけど…
msgctxt "0049 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I mean, every part of this school leaves a bad taste\n"
"in my mouth, but..."
msgstr ""

#. ここが一番気持ち悪いよ！！
#. なんかジャンルが違うモン！！
msgctxt "0050 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...this place is like number one gross! It's in a\n"
"whole different league of creepy!"
msgstr ""

#. 安心して！
#. 私はこっちで精一杯、応援してるから！
msgctxt "0051 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Don't worry! I'll cheer you on super loud! From way\n"
"over here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>安心していいんだろうか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's supposed to make me feel better...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうしたの、苗木。
#. 早く外に行こうよ…
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"What's wrong, Makoto? Let's hurry up and get outta\n"
"here..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、この機械は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What is this device?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで…何かの操作パネルみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like some kind of...control panel.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか、おおげさな雰囲気だな。
#. まるで軍事施設って感じで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's really over the top, though. Like some kind of\n"
"military installation or something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ロボットアニメとかのコクピットみたいだよね？
#. 山田が見たら狂喜乱舞するんじゃない？
msgctxt "0057 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it kinda looks like a mech cockpit, right?\n"
"Hifumi'd probably freak out if he saw it!"
msgstr ""

#. コクピット…？
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Cockpit...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマ模様の部屋…
#. コクピットのような操作パネル…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the Monokuma room has a control panel that looks\n"
"like some kind of...cockpit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…って事は、もしかして！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then could that mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よし！　とりあえず、いじってみようか！
#. そこのボタンを押してみるね！
msgctxt "0061 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Alright! Let's start poking at it or whatever! I'm\n"
"gonna start pushing buttons!"
msgstr ""

#. ま、待って…！
#. とりあえずで触ると…！
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"H-Hold on! You can't just \"or whatever\" something like\n"
"this!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…だけど、遅かった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it was too late...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんの指は、
#. すでに操作パネルのボタンを押していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina was already jabbing away at the control panel.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？　なんか音した？
msgctxt "0065 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Did you hear that?"
msgstr ""

#. 隣の部屋で、何か聞こえたみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I think it came from the other room."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さん…なんのボタンを押したの…？
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina...what did you push?"
msgstr ""

#. よ、よくわかんないんだけど…
msgctxt "0068 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I-I'm not totally sure, but..."
msgstr ""

#. そこの<CLT 3>“情報処理室”<CLT>って書いてあるボタン…
#. それを押したんだと思う。
msgctxt "0069 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...I think it was that one. The button that says <CLT 3>Data\n"
"Center<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 情報処理室…？
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Data center...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>操作パネルをよく見ると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took a good look at the control panel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには、部屋の名前が書かれたボタンが、
#. いくつも並んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and I saw a bunch of buttons, each with the name of\n"
"a room next to it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その中には、<CLT><CLT 3>“情報処理室”<CLT><CLT 4>というボタンも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just like Hina said, there was one labeled <CLT><CLT 3>Data\n"
"Center<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、朝日奈さんは、
#. このボタンを押したんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That must be the one she pushed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、情報処理室って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the data center...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あっちの…すぐ隣の部屋だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's right next door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まさに今…妙な音が聞こえた部屋…
#. さっきまでボクらがいた部屋…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The room we were just in... That's where the strange\n"
"noise came from.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと…確かめに行った方がいいかも…
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd probably better go check it out..."
msgstr ""

#. うんっ、お願い。
#. 私は怖いから、こっちで応援してるね！
msgctxt "0079 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yes please! I'm kinda scared out of my mind right now,\n"
"so I'll just...cheer you on from over here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここのボタンを押したら、
#. 隣の部屋から音が聞こえた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Pushing the button here made a sound in the other\n"
"room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>音が聞こえたのは隣の部屋だ…
#. さっきまでボクらがいた部屋…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I heard the strange noise from the room we just came\n"
"from...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうしたの、苗木。
#. 早く外に行こうよ…
msgctxt "0082 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"What's wrong, Makoto? Let's hurry up and get outta\n"
"here..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床にドアがあるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of hatch on the floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は、あの…
#. 何かよくわからない機械の方が気になるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But right now I'm more concerned about that weird\n"
"device...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床にドアがあるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of hatch on the floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は…先に情報処理室を確かめに行った方が
#. いいかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But right now I need to go check out the data\n"
"center...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ…調べるべき事があるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I'm done in here quite yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0088 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0089 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>情報処理室へ戻りますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Return to the data center?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
